  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "美麗ê島嶼"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：林榮淑</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">山頂、海墘、平洋</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">作穡人日曝雨沃無huah苦&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">田嬰尾蝶仔來做伴</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">稻仔吟詩歌風伴奏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Pan-kah粟鳥仔tàu伴唱</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">魚蝦墨賊仔跳bàn-pòo&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">城市摩天大樓世界零時差</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">規年thàng天鍵盤khiang-khiang叫</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">便利超商三步一間，五步一店</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">一年365工，一日24點鐘開門</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">月娘天星鬥陣leh做伴</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Bē放上班人來孤單</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">台灣，lán美麗ê島嶼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">台灣，lán生湠ê家園</span></p><div><br /></div><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報327期，2021年6月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"color: #999999; font-family: inherit;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #999999; font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div></div>"
  },
